phism）的意义下唯一。\n对于<MATH_0007>的满子范畴（full subcategories）中的范畴商（quotients），也有类似结论。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:272b83ab1335898529af5255e7eff12d2371a270b843014d82b86b64b2a648eb", "unit_id": "tag:048K:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "给定基底概形。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "基底上的代数空间。", "source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "此处的对象与商所在范畴。", "source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "此处为代数空间中的预关系。", "source_term": "relation", "target_term": "关系"}, {"context": "此处的范畴商所在范畴。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "存在时在唯一同构意义下唯一的范畴商。", "source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"context": "用于范畴商的唯一性。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "原范畴的满子范畴。", "source_term": "full subcategories", "target_term": "满子范畴"}, {"context": "满子范畴内的范畴商。", "source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商"}]}
